          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Usage</strong> imbued into a weapon ikon</p><hr /><p>The blaze of your divine spark is hot enough that it burns in not just the present, but the past and future as well. Whenever you score a critical hit with the imbued ikon, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed]{Doomed 1} or increases its doomed condition by 1. If the target's maximum dying value is reduced to 0 by this ability, it immediately dies in a flash of spiritual fire that reduces its body to ash. This effect applies even when the ikon is not empowered. The ikon also gains the following transcendence ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Transcendence—@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Burn out of Time]</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (spirit, transcendence, void)</p>\n<p>@Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.ZhVJ7EUTJngrIO2Z inline]</p>"
